Malius was added in '''Beta 36.0''' as an Epic 5/4 for 5G monster that allowed the user to return a monster of their choice from their hand back into their deck with Candy and a +2/+2 boost. '''Beta 55.0''' removed the given buffs and gave it +1 cost, but also gave it +1/+3.

=== Stats ===
ATK:

* 5 (Post Beta 36.0)
* 6 (Post Beta 55.0, Current)

HP:

* 4 (Post Beta 36.0)
* 7 (Post Beta 55.0, Current)

Cost:

* 5 (Post Beta 36.0)
* 6 (Post Beta 55.0, Current)

Abilities:

* Magic: Return a monster from your hand to your deck with +2/+2 and Candy. (Post Beta 36.0)
* Magic: Return a monster from your hand to your deck. (Post Beta 55.0, Current)

Rarity: Purple (Epic)
